Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.06,0:00:03.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, we're shining, running, forever!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.06,0:00:06.76,Default,,0,0,0,,The sea is calling out, so ride the waves!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.92,0:00:09.56,Default,,0,0,0,,We're all together as one,\Nso let's sail in the sun!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.64,0:00:11.82,Default,,0,0,0,,All our dreams are never ending,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.94,0:00:17.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Heartbeat, we will be one! Go ahead!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.54,0:00:26.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Even though our hearts have\Ntraveled different paths.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.64,0:00:28.18,Default,,0,0,0,,We are best friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.26,0:00:30.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Our freedom is our only compass.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.10,0:00:34.20,Default,,0,0,0,,That's pointing us along the\Nmany roads that come together.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.28,0:00:37.54,Default,,0,0,0,,We will keep on running forward every day.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.62,0:00:38.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Go east, go west.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.96,0:00:41.66,Default,,0,0,0,,As long as we keep looking to the horizon.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.74,0:00:44.42,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll see everything all crystal clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.60,0:00:50.28,Default,,0,0,0,,We're all so thrilled that we\Ncan't wait until the dawn arrives.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.90,0:00:54.52,Default,,0,0,0,,So we'll just bring the\Nsun ourselves to know.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.60,0:00:58.74,Default,,0,0,0,,If the winds blow, we're waiting\Nwhere we should be going, go?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.64,0:01:02.20,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right, we're\Nshining. Running forever!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.28,0:01:05.26,Default,,0,0,0,,All of our dreams will\Nmerge into one piece.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.34,0:01:07.98,Default,,0,0,0,,No matter where we go,\Nwe'll be fine and free.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.06,0:01:10.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Cause all our treasure is our strength.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.78,0:01:13.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, we're shining, running forever!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.36,0:01:16.22,Default,,0,0,0,,The sea is coming out, so ride away!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.46,0:01:19.14,Default,,0,0,0,,We're all together as well, so\Nlet's just stay with the sun!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.22,0:01:24.24,Default,,0,0,0,,All our dreams are never ending, so\Nlet's wake up, wake up, wake up, wake up!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.44,0:01:26.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Heartbeat, we will be one, go hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.40,0:01:32.81,Default,,0,0,0,,My darkness will swallow the\Nworld, just you wait and see!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.34,0:01:35.00,Default,,0,0,0,,You think I'll lose to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.32,0:01:37.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna be king of the pirates!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.78,0:01:40.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Roger's treasure belongs to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.44,0:01:47.62,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll ride non-stop and travel farther.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.70,0:01:52.28,Default,,0,0,0,,than we've ever gone And then tomorrow we
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.36,0:01:55.36,Default,,0,0,0,,will find suspense And then commence to
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.44,0:02:00.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Live out another day so intense.\NThat's right, we're shining,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.28,0:02:05.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Running forever. Let's go along\Nwith curiosity. Our feelings lead.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.32,0:02:10.94,Default,,0,0,0,,the way straight to a brand new day Into\Nanother adventure Come on, we're shining,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.24,0:02:16.74,Default,,0,0,0,,running forever Open the map inside your\Nheart and see No matter where we end up,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.86,0:02:21.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Our minds will never give up. There's\Na fire in our dreams and you can never,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.86,0:02:25.84,Default,,0,0,0,,never, never, never stop it\NWe will be one, go ahead!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.08,0:02:34.64,Default,,0,0,0,,The ring has completely capsized!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.16,0:02:38.44,Default,,0,0,0,,But somehow, the water\Nlevel is plunging with it!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.78,0:02:41.86,Default,,0,0,0,,We can no longer guarantee\Nthe safety of our guests!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.38,0:02:44.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Please evacuate the Coliseum at once!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.70,0:02:51.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't choke me!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.14,0:02:56.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm slipping!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.76,0:02:59.84,Default,,0,0,0,,My strength!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.38,0:03:02.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.29,0:03:05.25,Default,,0,0,0,,We weren't actually planning\Non giving that prize away!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.38,0:03:13.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.96,0:03:23.72,Default,,0,0,0,,You're all out of bounds.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.00,0:03:25.64,Default,,0,0,0,,That makes me the victor.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.08,0:03:28.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoever nabs this thing wins, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.24,0:03:30.60,Default,,0,0,0,,He's got it!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.30,0:03:32.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks for the prize.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.02,0:03:37.28,Default,,0,0,0,,We have a winner!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.54,0:03:41.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I know it seems trivial at the moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.98,0:03:43.34,Default,,0,0,0,,But in the thick of the chaos.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.42,0:03:46.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Our top dog has finally emerged.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.14,0:03:48.20,Default,,0,0,0,,The dark horse in the competition.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.28,0:03:49.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Has climbed to the top.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.54,0:03:50.86,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Lucy.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.94,0:03:53.70,Default,,0,0,0,,He is our champion.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.66,0:03:56.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Gross.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.57,0:04:00.97,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't fall out.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.06,0:04:02.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Much longer.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.04,0:04:11.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Sir, you think maybe you could\Nhelp me out, too? You're a pirate.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.14,0:04:14.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Pull yourself up by your own bootstraps.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.24,0:04:20.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Predictable, but so cool. Brace yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.36,0:04:22.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm about to light things up. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.48,0:04:29.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Cheater!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.39,0:04:31.44,Default,,0,0,0,,That fruit was supposed to be mine!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.18,0:04:33.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.09,0:04:35.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Isn't he from the Revolutionary Army?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.60,0:04:40.04,Default,,0,0,0,,God, that's hot.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.28,0:04:41.46,Default,,0,0,0,,It's really working.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.76,0:04:43.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, I guess that's my cue.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.04,0:04:48.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, it's not that hot, actually.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.66,0:04:50.84,Default,,0,0,0,,It's like I've become the fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.56,0:04:55.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Ace, I take your ability.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.44,0:04:59.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.68,0:05:01.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Mr. Sam!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.96,0:05:28.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn you Straw Hats, who\Ndo you think you are, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.24,0:05:31.52,Default,,0,0,0,,That was cruel! Servants!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.34,0:05:36.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't let any of you leave\Nhere alive, do you hear me?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.42,0:05:38.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Take Usopp and run!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.94,0:05:39.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure, Robin!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.34,0:05:41.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go, then!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.54,0:05:44.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't let him lay a\Ngoopy finger on Ozolin!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.30,0:05:49.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me take a wild guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.74,0:05:51.51,Default,,0,0,0,,You want to trash the factory?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.70,0:05:53.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Sound about right?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.82,0:05:55.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Niko Robin?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.58,0:05:58.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Stinky Stinky Chain!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.02,0:06:05.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold it! Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.76,0:06:10.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.30,0:06:19.10,Default,,0,0,0,,You little people, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.68,0:06:22.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Mind if I borrow this guy for a second?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.32,0:06:24.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah! Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.32,0:06:26.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah! Ah! Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.68,0:06:36.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm, he must have fought real hard\Nto save us if he's in this condition.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.86,0:06:40.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone, look!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.54,0:06:44.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I heard that some of you for a
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.76,0:06:47.54,Default,,0,0,0,,decade have been living as slaves.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.62,0:06:50.48,Default,,0,0,0,,It must have been hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.76,0:07:06.56,Default,,0,0,0,,If it weren't for you, we would have\Nlived out the rest of our days as toys.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.10,0:07:13.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Enslaved in this hellish nightmare, but\Nyou allowed us to reclaim our identities.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.16,0:07:16.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Gaze your eyes upon this man.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.16,0:07:23.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Remember this face well as the\Nhero who shattered our curse!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.10,0:07:31.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Captain Usopp! Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.98,0:07:34.52,Default,,0,0,0,,We thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.46,0:07:36.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Woo-hoo!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.82,0:07:44.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.73,0:07:45.56,Default,,0,0,0,,What fell?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.76,0:07:47.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Did the ceiling topple?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.88,0:08:01.06,Default,,0,0,0,,He looks godly!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.88,0:08:03.90,Default,,0,0,0,,That aura! My god!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.18,0:08:05.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't tell me!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.26,0:08:07.40,Default,,0,0,0,,We've been saved by a real deity!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.82,0:08:24.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Then that means we're\NWitnessing a miracle!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.02,0:08:38.98,Default,,0,0,0,,So saintly, so holy.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.76,0:08:47.08,Default,,0,0,0,,You
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.16,0:08:53.04,Default,,0,0,0,,people will
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.12,0:08:56.44,Default,,0,0,0,,be guided
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.52,0:09:01.38,Default,,0,0,0,,by me?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.36,0:09:08.78,Default,,0,0,0,,You people will be guided by me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.86,0:09:13.94,Default,,0,0,0,,You people will be guided by me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.02,0:09:18.92,Default,,0,0,0,,So you really are
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.00,0:09:21.94,Default,,0,0,0,,sent down from heaven.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.02,0:09:25.88,Default,,0,0,0,,We humbly bow down to you, great savior.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.70,0:09:34.70,Default,,0,0,0,,We will follow your command,\NGod. Usopp! Anything!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.02,0:09:36.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Just tell us what to do!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.78,0:09:39.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Show us the way, mighty God Usopp!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.26,0:09:40.40,Default,,0,0,0,,What must we do?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.22,0:09:47.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Well,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.22,0:09:48.60,Default,,0,0,0,,uh, in that case,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.82,0:09:54.60,Default,,0,0,0,,why don't you all destroy the factory\Nbehind me and rescue our little friends?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.76,0:10:00.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Gladly, great one! Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.76,0:10:17.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Uzzel, let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.56,0:10:34.60,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.86,0:10:36.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought Lucy was Straw Hat.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.58,0:10:39.99,Default,,0,0,0,,I was supposed to be the one\Nto eat the flame flame fruit.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.00,0:10:41.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Just great.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.28,0:10:45.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Now how am I supposed to\Nbreak this noose to Dofie?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.08,0:10:50.96,Default,,0,0,0,,What do these goons want?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.20,0:10:53.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Get him!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.11,0:10:54.46,Default,,0,0,0,,He works for Doflamingo!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.32,0:10:56.15,Default,,0,0,0,,ANNIHILATOR!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.23,0:10:57.64,Default,,0,0,0,,AND THEN THE FACTORY!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.96,0:10:58.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.10,0:11:00.75,Default,,0,0,0,,So are these the TOR people?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.32,0:11:10.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Yikes.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.06,0:11:14.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, this is gonna be\Nsomething fun to get used to.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.70,0:11:16.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, um...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.61,0:11:20.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Please don't take this as criticism,\Nbut that was kinda messed up, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.22,0:11:25.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I KNOW I CAN MAKE BARRIERS AND ALL, BUT\NTHAT DOESN'T MEAN THAT I'M INVINCIBLE.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.16,0:11:27.42,Default,,0,0,0,,UGH, NOT THAT GUY.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.62,0:11:29.74,Default,,0,0,0,,WHO ARE YOU?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.10,0:11:31.86,Default,,0,0,0,,COME OUT AND SAY IT ALREADY.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.26,0:11:34.09,Default,,0,0,0,,ME?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.76,0:11:40.84,Default,,0,0,0,,THE NAME IS SABO.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.18,0:11:50.14,Default,,0,0,0,,WE'RE MEMBERS OF THE REVOLUTIONARY ARMY.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.22,0:11:52.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Then the first Lucy is two?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.36,0:11:56.14,Default,,0,0,0,,No, but we're both enemies\Nof the world government.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.22,0:11:59.10,Default,,0,0,0,,That man will be the king\Nof the pirates someday.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.24,0:12:01.16,Default,,0,0,0,,His name is Straw Hat Luffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.78,0:12:02.76,Default,,0,0,0,,A pirate?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.78,0:12:04.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Yep.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.69,0:12:05.52,Default,,0,0,0,,And he's my brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.32,0:12:07.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Surprised?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.92,0:12:09.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Crazy, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.64,0:12:12.11,Default,,0,0,0,,And he's a hell of a guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.04,0:12:16.74,Default,,0,0,0,,He's still the same kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.10,0:12:18.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Reckless as hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.14,0:12:21.38,Default,,0,0,0,,That's funny, since I can\Nsay the same thing about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.82,0:12:22.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, now.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.24,0:12:27.94,Default,,0,0,0,,So wait, what brought you\Nguys to Dressrosa? Tell me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.86,0:12:37.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Weapons?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.42,0:12:43.14,Default,,0,0,0,,This place is exporting firearms that are\Ncontributing to wars around the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.32,0:12:48.88,Default,,0,0,0,,We're here to put a stop to that.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.96,0:12:52.38,Default,,0,0,0,,On several occasions,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.46,0:12:56.28,Default,,0,0,0,,the revolutionary army has sent\Noperatives to this kingdom;
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.36,0:12:59.70,Default,,0,0,0,,however, since they were turned into toys,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.78,0:13:04.60,Default,,0,0,0,,none of them ever returned, which is why\Nwe were unable to gather enough evidence.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.42,0:13:10.96,Default,,0,0,0,,That guy in blue's gonna be a problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.48,0:13:13.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, that's Sabo, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.44,0:13:16.38,Default,,0,0,0,,What's the number two of the\NRevolutionary Army doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.46,0:13:17.93,Default,,0,0,0,,We have to warn the crew!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.56,0:13:23.32,Default,,0,0,0,,It seems they're manufacturing\Nthe weapons elsewhere, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.02,0:13:24.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.74,0:13:26.78,Default,,0,0,0,,But where?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.04,0:13:29.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Who's producing all these firearms?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.26,0:13:38.20,Default,,0,0,0,,if we can uncover the truth we'll have\Nsomething substantial to bring back to dragon
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.24,0:14:10.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Yuffei!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.15,0:14:12.13,Default,,0,0,0,,How dare you kill the young master!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.22,0:14:14.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll blow you away!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.72,0:14:31.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Buffalo!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.04,0:14:42.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Trophy!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.00,0:14:48.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm here to save you! Straw Hat? Oh, good!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.06,0:14:49.94,Default,,0,0,0,,You didn't die!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.20,0:14:53.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought we agreed you'd\Ndestroy the factory, Straw Hat.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.08,0:14:53.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.34,0:14:55.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Or not?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.58,0:14:57.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Here's the keys to his handcuffs.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.58,0:14:59.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow, you're ready for anything, aren't ya?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.06,0:15:00.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.97,0:15:01.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat Violet!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.62,0:15:05.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't let you lay a finger on...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.60,0:15:09.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Young Master?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.56,0:15:13.68,Default,,0,0,0,,There, King Rick.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.98,0:15:15.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry for the wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.26,0:15:17.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Just a sec.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.36,0:15:19.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna get you out of here, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.40,0:15:21.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks, but I'll pass.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.58,0:15:24.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Our alliance from here\Non out is terminated.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.46,0:15:26.50,Default,,0,0,0,,So get lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.76,0:15:28.94,Default,,0,0,0,,You're so selfish.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.26,0:15:32.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to keep working\Nwith you, so deal with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.14,0:15:33.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Who's the selfish one now?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.12,0:15:36.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry, use the key. Oh, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.20,0:15:43.04,Default,,0,0,0,,You do realize what the Alliance\Ncalled off were enemies?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.12,0:15:45.98,Default,,0,0,0,,If you set me free, I'll kill you!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.06,0:15:50.46,Default,,0,0,0,,That's it—this is hard enough to\Nunlock with this dumb sea prism stone!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.54,0:15:54.52,Default,,0,0,0,,So stop squirming, steady you two—aren't\Npaying attention to me at all?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.60,0:15:55.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.51,0:15:56.34,Default,,0,0,0,,are you
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.06,0:16:02.14,Default,,0,0,0,,He's the wall guy! Mingo!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.80,0:16:08.58,Default,,0,0,0,,What a way to go, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.92,0:16:10.34,Default,,0,0,0,,That was a surprise.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.04,0:16:13.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, Mingo is alive?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.32,0:16:15.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Young master! You're alive?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.08,0:16:18.76,Default,,0,0,0,,How is this possible?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.70,0:16:22.36,Default,,0,0,0,,The whole country should be spiraling into
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.44,0:16:25.26,Default,,0,0,0,,chaos now that all the\Ntoys have been freed.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.54,0:16:29.28,Default,,0,0,0,,And for whatever reason,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.70,0:16:33.62,Default,,0,0,0,,we have some members of the\NRevolutionary Army nosing around, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.46,0:16:39.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm left in a difficult position.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.38,0:16:43.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I have no other choice\Nbut to use the birdcage.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.28,0:16:46.56,Default,,0,0,0,,The birdcage?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.46,0:16:50.76,Default,,0,0,0,,You remember, don't you, Law?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.44,0:16:59.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Think we should book it?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.28,0:17:01.98,Default,,0,0,0,,They're on a rampage and\Nheaded straight here!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.06,0:17:03.72,Default,,0,0,0,,This is above my pay grade!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.82,0:17:08.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, lucky for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.72,0:17:12.37,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't think that they can\Nactually reach us without the key.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.46,0:17:21.08,Default,,0,0,0,,You know, this factory means\Neverything to the young master.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.16,0:17:23.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Even if the ceiling collapses,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.68,0:17:28.03,Default,,0,0,0,,there won't be a scratch on this place\Nsince it's made of sea prism stone.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.22,0:17:30.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Besides, need I remind you?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.86,0:17:38.38,Default,,0,0,0,,We've got two of the top\Nexecutives watching over it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.42,0:17:49.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Trust me when I say no one\Ncan get through these two.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.32,0:17:53.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Our impenetrable defenses\Nreally are impenetrable!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.60,0:17:56.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Koala!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.78,0:17:59.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Robin!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.10,0:18:02.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought I recognized you back there.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.62,0:18:04.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Have you been well? Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.92,0:18:07.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Sabo! Hack!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.40,0:18:08.93,Default,,0,0,0,,You haven't changed a bit!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.24,0:18:10.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.15,0:18:11.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Run into Luffy yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.60,0:18:14.64,Default,,0,0,0,,He... okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.72,0:18:15.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.96,0:18:18.06,Default,,0,0,0,,This guy is one of our crewmates.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.32,0:18:19.40,Default,,0,0,0,,He's Usopp.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.54,0:18:24.08,Default,,0,0,0,,He should probably rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.84,0:18:27.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Doflamingo!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.46,0:18:30.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Pardon me, but I must hastily proceed.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.62,0:18:50.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess things are starting\Nto heat up down there.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.12,0:18:51.89,Default,,0,0,0,,I hope they don't need a hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.46,0:18:54.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, whatever.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.56,0:18:56.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I gotta find that rock guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.78,0:18:58.22,Default,,0,0,0,,What a pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.68,0:19:04.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I suppose I shouldn't\Ndelay this further.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.70,0:19:06.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Shut your damn mouth!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.70,0:19:12.70,Default,,0,0,0,,How can you still be alive, Doflamingo?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.32,0:19:21.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you want me to show you how to\Nproperly behead a man? Soldier!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.02,0:19:23.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Kidos, behind you!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.72,0:19:26.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Just like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.72,0:19:30.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaidou, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.72,0:19:39.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn Straw Hat!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.72,0:19:46.25,Default,,0,0,0,,There's two young masters?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.60,0:19:52.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, by mistake.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.76,0:19:55.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, jerk, gump, gump!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.68,0:19:57.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh, armaments.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.92,0:20:02.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Jack Statlin!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.22,0:20:16.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.58,0:20:36.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Lufin-Lan!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.64,0:20:39.76,Default,,0,0,0,,But how?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.08,0:20:41.22,Default,,0,0,0,,He has a double?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.76,0:20:44.78,Default,,0,0,0,,That hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.62,0:20:50.82,Default,,0,0,0,,It seems he's made a\Nmarionette out of his strength.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.18,0:20:53.12,Default,,0,0,0,,That technique, what is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.94,0:20:58.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Rick, a quick question.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.08,0:21:02.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you remember how you felt\Nthat evening ten years ago?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.26,0:21:10.26,Default,,0,0,0,,The one where you torched the town and\Nsliced your beloved citizens to pieces?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.76,0:21:15.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, kill me!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.96,0:21:20.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I could never forget such a tragedy.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.06,0:21:23.50,Default,,0,0,0,,That nightmare haunts me to this day.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.28,0:21:28.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Compared to what's about to unfold,\Nthat will seem like a sweet memory.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.56,0:21:30.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.36,0:21:36.42,Default,,0,0,0,,You're mad. What are you planning?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.62,0:21:38.68,Default,,0,0,0,,You cannot repeat such a callous act.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.76,0:21:39.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Hush now.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.67,0:21:42.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going to release you all pika I
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.90,0:21:49.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Think it's time you scatter these roaches
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.72,0:22:21.30,Default,,0,0,0,,The Flamingo, you have done\Nenough damage to these people!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.32,0:22:33.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't put them through anymore!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.38,0:22:36.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Hang on, guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.66,0:22:37.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Gum-Gum!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.60,0:22:40.72,Default,,0,0,0,,No! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.04,0:23:09.28,Default,,0,0,0,,He chucked us right out of the palace.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.54,0:23:14.54,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no chance of us getting\Nnear Doflamingo if Pika is with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.84,0:23:17.84,Default,,0,0,0,,A birdcage.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.76,0:23:20.59,Default,,0,0,0,,It's starting.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.54,0:23:41.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Skye!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.45,0:23:42.28,Default,,0,0,0,,What's that, sir?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.60,0:23:45.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Who knows?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.80,0:23:47.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's not stay and find out!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.48,0:23:52.77,Default,,0,0,0,,We're no match for Doflamingo, so\Nthere's no point in lashing out at him!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.98,0:23:55.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Captain, watch out! Something's there!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.56,0:23:59.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.58,0:24:01.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? Razors?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.68,0:24:03.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.59,0:24:04.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Are these bars always here?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.90,0:24:11.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Before the truth behind this regime\Neven has a chance to get out.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.56,0:24:17.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Doflamingo will kill\Nevery person in Dressrosa.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.48,0:24:23.22,Default,,0,0,0,,This fence stretches as far as we can see.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.82,0:24:26.18,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.38,0:24:27.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Where's the exit?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.88,0:24:38.26,Default,,0,0,0,,What are these beams around us?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.34,0:24:41.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Vice Admiral Bastille, I\Ncan't contact headquarters.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.32,0:24:44.00,Default,,0,0,0,,What? Same here.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.32,0:24:46.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm having technical\Ndifficulties reaching the base.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.94,0:24:49.71,Default,,0,0,0,,How am I going to report\Nthe events from today?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.68,0:25:00.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.59,0:25:02.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't fire at someone's home!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.96,0:25:03.79,Default,,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.87,0:25:04.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.79,0:25:07.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't control my own body!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.34,0:25:09.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey! Stop that!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.94,0:25:17.36,Default,,0,0,0,,My arm's moving on its own!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.82,0:25:26.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop me!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.66,0:25:28.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Everybody, stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.12,0:25:35.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Parasite String
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.72,0:25:39.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Sir, reporting in.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.54,0:25:42.18,Default,,0,0,0,,It's pandemonium all across Dressrosa.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.58,0:25:45.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone's going wild and\Nattacking one another.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.58,0:25:52.99,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sad to inform you that there's even\Nsubmarines attacking the civilians.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:53.16,0:25:56.18,Default,,0,0,0,,We need backup or many\Ninnocent people will die.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.14,0:25:59.68,Default,,0,0,0,,What's going on now?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.74,0:26:07.80,Default,,0,0,0,,The King's Plateau is sinking!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.26,0:26:13.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.52,0:26:15.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Why is the ground shaky?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.54,0:26:16.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Who's doing this?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:17.12,0:26:18.06,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Pika.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.22,0:26:24.04,Default,,0,0,0,,He's changing the terrain\Nwith his stone powers.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:26.04,0:26:28.64,Default,,0,0,0,,The royal palace is running away!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.70,0:26:30.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.84,0:26:32.36,Default,,0,0,0,,You get back here!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.90,0:26:43.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Look out!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.30,0:26:45.44,Default,,0,0,0,,The factory is ascending! What?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:45.64,0:26:47.17,Default,,0,0,0,,How is that even possible?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.28,0:26:51.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:53.80,0:26:56.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Please stop me!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:00.66,0:27:02.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Look at the flower field!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:03.18,0:27:04.86,Default,,0,0,0,,It's rising up!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:05.06,0:27:07.76,Default,,0,0,0,,And pulling the whole town with it!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:24.90,0:27:28.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Citizens and guests of\NDressrosa, greetings.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:28.50,0:27:30.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Might I have a word?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:31.48,0:27:36.12,Default,,0,0,0,,When I started my reign, I could have\Neasily ruled over you with an iron fist.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.72,0:27:38.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Instead, I was benevolent.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.50,0:27:41.40,Default,,0,0,0,,But now that you know the truth,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:42.00,0:27:47.12,Default,,0,0,0,,there's no doubt in my mind that the vast\Nmajority of you would like to see me dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:48.18,0:27:51.12,Default,,0,0,0,,That's why I've prepared\Na little game for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:54.48,0:27:57.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Your objective is to assassinate me.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:58.50,0:28:00.94,Default,,0,0,0,,You can find me in the royal palace.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:01.22,0:28:03.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't be going anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.64,0:28:05.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Take my life and the game ends.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:06.52,0:28:08.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I die, you win.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.50,0:28:09.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Real simple, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:11.42,0:28:15.56,Default,,0,0,0,,And since I'm so generous, I'll give\Nyou a second way to win as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.48,0:28:20.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm about to read out a list of\Npeople, so get your pencils ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:21.02,0:28:24.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Should you manage to bring me\Ntheir dead bodies, you win.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:25.12,0:28:30.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Also, I will award a sizable bounty\Nfor each and every head I receive.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.20,0:28:34.66,Default,,0,0,0,,It's kill or be killed.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.98,0:28:43.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Every person in the kingdom\Nis now a bounty hunter.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:43.90,0:28:46.24,Default,,0,0,0,,And the only way for you to survive
Dialogue: 0,0:28:47.20,0:28:50.30,Default,,0,0,0,,is for you to take the\Nlife of another person.
